<title>FINLAND: MARIEBERG HAS OVER 20 PCT OF AAMULEHTI.</title>
<headline>MARIEBERG HAS OVER 20 PCT OF AAMULEHTI.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish media group Aamulehti Oy said on Friday Swedish group Tidnings AB Marieberg's holding in Aamulehti had risen due to the conversion of bonds to above 20 percent of shares and votes.</p>
<p>&quot;Tidnings AB Marieberg's holding corresponds 27.4 percent of the share capital and 21.1 percent of votes in Aamulehti,&quot; Aamulehti said in a statement.</p>
</text>
